6</a>]. 한국수출입은행은 달러채보다 낮은 금리로 딤섬본드 공모 발행을 성사시키며 발행 시장의 새 이정표를 세웠고, 아카마이 테크놀로지는 25억 달러 규모의 전환사채 발행을 완료하며 자금 조달에 나섰습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOTFdUSmZiRGJGOG5mRDBqc0JHTENNUlFyQUN4S2o1aWhYYmk5aGU1QjM0dHBBX25TQnZsblZFOW1pd1c4UlBaemRIMGI3SEZXdy1OYTZsRHNSaHBxQW1hNUlxSnNTalprSWlSXzhYaDFiQ0puZGtSQ1BuLV9pYW1hdVllWFlxVHJs?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#4</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE5QcXEzOVZ4VkhwTXA3bWgzc2J1SEJQemhseXc0cFdIUDUycDR5YlZYdzU5REVWZjk3c0x0SDAzZWVGa0puTXJXN3h1QTdFQTBORG1Gd2hUbGZFSFp6X1NSUmhMNnV2ZlR2MUxhWU9NeEE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#17</a>].\n\n<b>3. 코스닥 상장사 CB 남발에 따른 주주가치 희석 리스크</b>\n올리패스, 하이퍼코퍼레이션, 애드바이오텍 등 다수 코스닥 기업들이 기말 현금 대비 과도한 누적 전환사채(CB) 발행으로 유동성 및 지배구조 압박을 겪고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1BLVdSUFNVZWc5aEVYa21SdWw0bWFFQ05MZklfRDN3Ykxfdk5odzhmYzdsVE8tZTNOMk5DOHpTSy1IcVYyb1ZPRDRMTnlJZjNGcnhySklFdE04LWs?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#20</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE9TSUtDNXR2Q2wwa0J1S1J6cHRzOTdKaGV2NEh3TjBrVGpfajBMMHF4RnJySnlzSFdwZmFUYmMtamJJdTB0Xzl4c1BScXNQRVhSVnJQRGFCekRNUmc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#24</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFB6RVVlT1dGWElBeXhQanlveWFHc3lSR2kxeUdrSXRBenRDa01QV2RmOGUxcy05MXpEY201ZV9YVFFFT0ZTZmpkVlVPNV85UTRVMnhDYnQzT3lrYlk?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#28</a>]. 시장에서는 이들 기업의 단일 회차 잠재 희석률이 최대 36%에 달해 주주 리스크와 회생절차 등의 불확실성이 증대되고 있다는 지적이 나옵니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1BLVdSUFNVZWc5aEVYa21SdWw0bWFFQ05MZklfRDN3Ykxfdk5odzhmYzdsVE8tZTNOMk5DOHpTSy1IcVYyb1ZPRDRMTnlJZjNGcnhySklFdE04LWs?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#20</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5HVk1GM0JlWDk1Um9BYWpaSFp3TERDbUhsLTBYWUdmUVBsckRJdDdWLUNHbXJmU2Y3N2t0U1FKS3I1U1RiOGdlWFRZazJ1VlpFcnhzVHlXRkVQcXp1amc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#26</